  <div class="v65-product-attributeLabel">Tasting Notes</div>
  <div class="v65-product-attributeValue">Pale in color and crisp with coursing minerality this rosé explodes with aromas of flowering strawberries, watermelon and Granny Smith apples. On the palate are hints of pink grapefruit, Rainier cherries and wet stone that carry through to a refreshing finish.</div>
